 * |-----|
 * |     | teddy masks
 * |     |
 * |-----|
 * |     | reinforcement mask table for bucket 0..7
 * |     |
 * |-----|
 * |     | reinforcement mask table for bucket 8..15 (FAT teddy)
 * |     |
 * |-----|
 * |     | confirm
 * |     |
 * |     |
 * |-----|
 * |     | flood control
